# Sample building GeoJSONs are committed so the live atlas can
# serve them directly. Larger / per-area extracts stay in out/ and
# are generated on demand by scripts/osm-buildings-to-geojson.py.
!public/*.geojson

# 3D building PMTiles (432,077 OSM buildings, ~17 MB) lives in R2
# bucket bkk-tiles, not in public/. The Worker proxies
# /bkk-buildings.pmtiles from R2 with HTTP Range passthrough so the
# pmtiles client lib can stream. Regenerate via
# scripts/generate-3d-tiles.sh and push with:
#   npx wrangler r2 object put bkk-tiles/buildings/bangkok.pmtiles \
#     --file=/tmp/bkk-buildings/bangkok-buildings-h.pmtiles --remote
public/*.pmtiles

